Clearly, the vectors involved in the definition of the newly generated linear space, i.\,e.
\[
    \mathcal{T}^{{\bar i}}=\left\{
\xi \in \R^{2n}\,\left\vert\, \begin{array}{l} \begin{pmatrix}

Dh_p(\bar x),0\end{pmatrix} \xi=0, p \in P, 
