Further, by straightforward application of the implicit function theorem and due to Lemma \ref{lem:QandE}a) and \ref{lem:QandE}b), we find a sequence of vectors $\xi^{\bar i}_t \in \mathcal{T}^{ \bar i}_{t}$ that converges to $\xi^{\bar i}$ for $t \to 0$. 
